                <p>See <title>Ep. Carn</title>., Vol. XII, p. 263, ff. No. 23.</p>
                <p n="1">At the top are cut in relief the figures of the sun and crescent over a <foreign>liṅga</foreign> on a pedestal, and a sword pointing upward. Below these are the figures of a cow and a calf.</p>
